---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const domain = 'https://allshoesizeconverter.com';
const pageCanonical = `${domain}/privacy-policy/`;
const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy: Data and Cookie Protection';
const pageDescription = 'Read the privacy policy of AllShoeSizeConverter. Learn how we handle client-side calculations, cookies, analytics, and your data protection rights.';
const ogImage = `${domain}/og-image.png`;
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  canonical={pageCanonical}
  ogImage={ogImage}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={pageDescription} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={pageCanonical} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
  </Fragment>

  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[
      { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
      { label: 'Privacy Policy' },
    ]} />

    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-inner">
        <p class="mono-eyebrow">Data Protection &amp; Transparency</p>
        <h1 class="display-xl" style="font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px)">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub body-lg">Last Updated: September 23, 2026. Your privacy is fundamental to our platform design.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body-band">
      <div class="legal-inner">
        <article class="legal-card card-elevated">
          
          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">1. Overview and privacy commitments</h2>
            <p>At AllShoeSizeConverter (accessible from <a href="https://allshoesizeconverter.com/">https://allshoesizeconverter.com/</a>), shoe size conversion calculations execute locally inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript. We do not require user account registration, and we do not store, catalogue, or transmit individual foot measurements or demographic inputs to our servers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">2. Information we do not collect</h2>
            <p>We do not create user accounts or store foot measurements entered into the sizing tools. Third-party analytics and advertising services process browser and device data under their respective policies.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>We do not ask for or store your name, residential address, email address, phone number, or payment details when you use our conversion calculators.</li>
              <li>Foot dimensions, millimeter lengths, and shoe sizes entered into our tools are processed in temporary browser memory and cleared when you navigate away.</li>
              <li>All conversion tables, calculators, and brand guides are accessible without account credentials.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">3. Information collected automatically</h2>
            <p>When you visit AllShoeSizeConverter, technical data is recorded through our hosting infrastructure and measurement services:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address, browser version, operating system, referring URL, timestamp, and requested pages. Cloudflare processes this data for security, DDoS defense, and network routing.</li>
              <li>Google Analytics monitors aggregate traffic metrics according to Google privacy policies.</li>
              <li>Microsoft Clarity records behavioral metrics, heatmaps, and session navigation to improve site performance. Usage data is captured using first-party and third-party cookies. For more details, review the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">4. Cookies and local storage</h2>
            <p>Our website uses local storage and cookies for functional, security, and measurement purposes:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>We store a preference key named <code>theme-preference</code> (values: <code>light</code> or <code>dark</code>) in browser <code>localStorage</code> so your visual preference persists across visits. This storage contains no personal identifier.</li>
              <li>Cloudflare sets standard security cookies to identify trusted web traffic and mitigate automated attacks.</li>
              <li>Analytics services place cookies in your browser to record user sessions and evaluate site performance.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">5. Google AdSense and third-party advertising cookies</h2>
            <p>Google and other third-party vendors use cookies to serve ads on this website based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the internet.</p>
            <p>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits to this site and other sites on the internet.</p>
            <p>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, users can opt out of third-party vendor use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AboutAds Consumer Choice Tool</a> or the <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Your Online Choices portal</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">6. Third-party links and retailers</h2>
            <p>Our guides reference footwear manufacturers including Nike, Adidas, Clarks, New Balance, and Bata. When clicking external links to third-party stores, their independent privacy policies govern all interactions and cookies. We encourage reviewing their policies directly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">7. Data protection rights</h2>
            <p>Under international privacy regulations including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA):</p>
            <ul>
              <li>You have the right to request access to personal information held about you. Because AllShoeSizeConverter does not build personal profiles or require accounts, we store no records linked to individual identities.</li>
              <li>You may clear browser cookies and local storage at any time through your browser settings.</li>
              <li>We do not sell, rent, monetize, or trade visitor data.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">8. Children's privacy</h2>
            <p>AllShoeSizeConverter does not knowingly collect personal data from children under the age of 13. Children's sizing calculations execute client-side inside the user's browser.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="heading-md">9. Policy updates and contact information</h2>
            <p>We update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect technological or legal requirements.</p>
            <p>For questions regarding this policy, contact Kamlesh Choudhary through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or by email at support@allshoesizeconverter.com.</p>
          </div>

        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: var(--v-canvas);
    min-height: 80vh;
  }
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 56px 24px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, var(--v-mesh-1), transparent 60%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v-hairline);
  }
  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    color: var(--v-mute);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .legal-body-band {
    padding: 48px 24px 80px;
  }
  .legal-card {
    background: var(--v-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--v-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--v-r-lg);
    padding: 44px;
    box-shadow: var(--v-shadow-whisper);
  }
  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .legal-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .legal-section h2 {
    color: var(--v-ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-section p {
    color: var(--v-body);
    line-height: 26px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .legal-section ul {
    color: var(--v-body);
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--v-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  code {
    background: var(--v-hairline-soft);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--v-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 24px 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
